summary:
  A second reading goes out while the first is in flight.

history:
  The engine keeps one reading's number and file. A second one takes their
  place, the first helper's answer is dropped, and its station is connected
  to again for nothing.

target:
  package/contents/ui/Loudness.qml

find:
              settle.restart();
              return;
          }
          if (kind && kind.busy)

replace:
              settle.restart();
          }
          if (kind && kind.busy)

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_loudness.qml::test_one_reading_at_a_time.
  1 line(s) shorter.
